. cd `"`root'/02_code/10_analysis"'
<PACKAGE_ROOT>/02_code/10_analysis

. do "UP_A1_02_measurement.do" corrected2x 

. * UP_A1_02_measurement.do -- GENERATED by C2_A1_12_make_upair.py from A1_02_m
> easurement.do; do not edit.
. * Changes: cluster variable pair_id -> unordered_pair_id (4 vce, 0 stack, 1 A
